`train_soundscapes_labels.csv` has duplicated records
Hi, all.

I noticed that train_soundscapes_labels.csv has duplicated records.
To be more specific, there are two identical records for each data point.

import pandas as pd

train_ss_labels = pd.read_csv("/kaggle/input/competitions/birdclef-2026/train_soundscapes_labels.csv")

print(len(train_ss_labels))  # -> 1478
print(train_ss_labels.duplicated().sum())  # -> 739
You just need to apply .drop_diplicates() when using train_soundscapes_labels.csv, but I don't know why it has duplicated records.

